# The web app (marketing site only, in Foundation) does not read any
# environment variables yet — see docs/BUILD_STATUS.md for why an
# account/data portal was deliberately not built in Milestone 01.
#
# When a later milestone adds one, add NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL and
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY here (Next.js only exposes vars
# prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ to client code — see docs/SECURITY.md §14-15).
# NEVER put a Supabase service-role key in a NEXT_PUBLIC_ variable.
